@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8081

### Process the English recording and save its tasks and visit report in Google Sheets
# Run make run first. Each request creates new CRM entries.
# @name uploadAudioMessage
# @timeout 600 s
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/audiomessage
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=voiceassistant-boundary

--voiceassistant-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="anna-agile-robots.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./audioexamples/anna-agile-robots.wav
--voiceassistant-boundary--

### Completed Siemens visit: one visit report, no tasks
# "I visited David from Siemens today. Their engineering team is evaluating fifty licenses. The budget has already been approved."
# @name uploadVisitOnly
# @timeout 600 s
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/audiomessage
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=voiceassistant-boundary

--voiceassistant-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="david-siemens-visit.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./audioexamples/david-siemens-visit.wav
--voiceassistant-boundary--

### Bosch call reminder: one task for next Tuesday, no visit report
# "Remind me next Tuesday to call Emma from Bosch about renewing twenty five licenses."
# @name uploadCallReminder
# @timeout 600 s
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/audiomessage
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=voiceassistant-boundary

--voiceassistant-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="emma-bosch-reminder.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./audioexamples/emma-bosch-reminder.wav
--voiceassistant-boundary--

### Unintelligible audio: a short noise fragment without speech
# A valid half-second WAV recording, too short to recognize speech.
# Expected: HTTP 503 processing_unavailable; no CRM records are created.
# @name uploadUnintelligibleAudio
# @timeout 600 s
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/audiomessage
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=voiceassistant-boundary

--voiceassistant-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="unintelligible-noise.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./audioexamples/unintelligible-noise.wav
--voiceassistant-boundary--
